{"headword":"מִישׁוֹר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.8\">Je 48:8</a></sup> <strong>level place, uprightness</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:11\" href=\"/Psalms.27.11\">ψ 27:11</a> + 9 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִישֹׁר</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 4:7\" href=\"/Zechariah.4.7\">Zc 4:7</a> (v. Baer) + 12 times;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"3 antith. <span dir=\"rtl\">הר(ים)</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:23\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.23\">1 K 20:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.25\">25</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 4:7\" href=\"/Zechariah.4.7\">Zc 4:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עָקֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.4\">Is 40:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲקַשִּׁים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.16\">42:16</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁפֵלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.10\">2 Ch 26:10</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵמֶק</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 21:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.21.13\">Je 21:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמִּישׁוֹר</span> specifically of the elevated plateau or 3 between the Arnon and Heshbon <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.10\">Dt 3:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:43\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.43\">4:43</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:9\" href=\"/Joshua.13.9\">Jos 13:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:16\" href=\"/Joshua.13.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:17\" href=\"/Joshua.13.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:21\" href=\"/Joshua.13.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 20:8\" href=\"/Joshua.20.8\">20:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.8\">Je 48:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.21\">21</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>level place</em> (free from obstacles), fig. for place of safety, comfort, and prosperity <a data-ref=\"Psalms 26:12\" href=\"/Psalms.26.12\">ψ 26:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ארח מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:11\" href=\"/Psalms.27.11\">27:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 143:10\" href=\"/Psalms.143.10\">143:10</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>uprightness</em> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵישָׁר</span> <strong>2</strong>), in government <a data-ref=\"Psalms 67:5\" href=\"/Psalms.67.5\">ψ 67:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁבֶט מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:7\" href=\"/Psalms.45.7\">45:7</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צֶדֶק</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.4\">Is 11:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁלוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:6\" href=\"/Malachi.2.6\">Mal 2:6</a>."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB04290","strong_numbers":["4334"],"next_hw":"שָׁרוֹן","prev_hw":"מֵישָׁר","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["4793"],"TWOT":["930f"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}